  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Civil Society to Combat Corruption and Serious Organized Crime</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project intends to raise awareness of the anti-corruption threat and build support for action against grand corruption, build capacity among public bodies to combat organized crime and grand corruption, strengthen transparency, accountability and anti-corruption legislation and build leadership to challenge harmful social norms and anti-social behavior.</narrative>
  </description>
